WEBVTT

00:03:30.716 --> 00:03:32.436
And these waves,

00:03:32.436 --> 00:03:35.516
their path continues on into the islands,

00:03:35.516 --> 00:03:38.596
bringing with it garbage
we’ve thrown into it.

00:03:40.196 --> 00:03:44.516
You see the graves of your loved ones
submerged in water,

00:03:44.516 --> 00:03:45.516
littered.

00:03:46.396 --> 00:03:48.796
Then the vegetation starts to brown;

00:03:48.796 --> 00:03:49.916
it is dying.

00:03:51.476 --> 00:03:53.316
The soil becomes salinated.

00:03:54.276 --> 00:03:56.516
You pray the bigger trees hold on

00:03:56.516 --> 00:04:00.436
for their roots are needed
to prevent further erosion.